member.summary:
Registers  as a singleton service.

Usage in Program.cs:

builder.Services.AddWhatsApp(options =>
{
    options.SessionDirectory = "./whatsapp-session";
    options.AutoReconnect = true;
});


Then inject IWhatsAppService or WhatsAppClient into your controllers.

WhatsApp Message proto (field numbers from Baileys WAProto.proto).
Only the fields we need for text message extraction are implemented;
all others are safely skipped.

The main Dawa WhatsApp client. Connects to WhatsApp Web and allows
sending and receiving messages without a Node.js dependency.

Usage:

var client = WhatsAppClient.Create("./wa-session");
client.QRCodeReceived += (_, qr) => Console.WriteLine("Scan: " + qr);
client.MessageReceived += (_, msg) => Console.WriteLine(msg);
await client.ConnectAsync();
await client.WaitUntilConnectedAsync();
await client.SendMessageAsync("+31612345678", "Hello from Dawa!");
